.TH man 1 "29 Jul 2025" "0.11.1" "Tuba man page"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
Tuba \- Browse the Fediverse
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B dev.geopjr.Tuba
.RI [OPTION?]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
This manual page documents briefly the
.B dev.geopjr.Tuba.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.SS "Help Options:"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show help options
.TP
\fB\-\-help\-all\fR
Show all help options
.TP
\fB\-\-help\-gapplication\fR
Show GApplication options
.SS "GApplication Options:"
.TP
\fB\-\-gapplication\-service\fR
Enter GApplication service mode (use from D\-Bus service files)
.SS "Application Options:"
.TP
\fB\-\-hidden\fR
Do not show main window on start
.br
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Danial Behzadi (dani.behzi@ubuntu.com)
.br
